---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Your Koa’s Wedding Journey Starts Here" description="Next steps after submitting a wedding inquiry to Koa’s Events." canonical="https://www.koasevents.com/wedding-inquiry-thank-you/">
<Header overlay={false}/>
<main>
<section class="py-20 lg:py-28"><div class="container-shell max-w-5xl text-center"><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Wedding inquiry received</p><h1 class="display mx-auto mt-5 max-w-4xl text-6xl leading-[.94] sm:text-7xl">Your Koa’s wedding journey starts here.</h1><p class="mx-auto mt-7 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-[var(--koa-ink)]/68">Your wedding details are in. The next step is a short discovery conversation so we can confirm fit, availability and the right starting point.</p></div></section>
<section class="bg-[var(--koa-sand)] py-20"><div class="container-shell grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3">
<article class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-[var(--koa-forest)] p-7 text-white"><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-amber-light)]">Step 1</p><h2 class="display mt-8 text-4xl">Request your discovery call.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-white/64">Tell us the best days and times to reach you. We’ll use those preferences to arrange the conversation.</p><a href="#schedule" class="link-arrow mt-7 text-white">Choose preferences →</a></article>
<article class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[var(--koa-line)] bg-white p-7"><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Step 2</p><h2 class="display mt-8 text-4xl">Explore the Signature Experience.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--koa-ink)]/64">See how the private property, ceremony, reception, bar and planning support fit together.</p><a href="/signature-wedding/" class="link-arrow mt-7">Explore Signature →</a></article>
<article class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[var(--koa-line)] bg-white p-7"><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Step 3</p><h2 class="display mt-8 text-4xl">Get a feel for the property.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--koa-ink)]/64">Use the gallery now; a dedicated property film can be added here once the finished video is ready.</p><a href="/gallery/" class="link-arrow mt-7">View gallery →</a></article>
</div></section>
<section id="schedule" class="py-24 lg:py-32"><div class="container-shell grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-24"><div><p class="eyebrow text-[var(--koa-clay)]">Discovery call</p><h2 class="display mt-5 text-5xl leading-[1] sm:text-6xl">Give us a few windows that work for you.</h2><p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--koa-ink)]/62">This is the interim direct scheduling flow. When a calendar platform is selected, this section can be replaced with real-time appointment booking without changing the rest of the funnel.</p></div>
<form name="koa-discovery-call-request" method="POST" action="/thank-you/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-[var(--koa-line)] bg-white p-7 shadow-[var(--shadow-soft)]"><input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="koa-discovery-call-request"/><p class="hidden"><label>Don’t fill this out: <input name="bot-field"/></label></p><div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Name<input class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] bg-[var(--koa-ivory)] px-4 py-3" name="name" required/></label><label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Email<input class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] bg-[var(--koa-ivory)] px-4 py-3" name="email" type="email" required/></label><label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Best day<input class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] bg-[var(--koa-ivory)] px-4 py-3" type="date" name="preferredDate" required/></label><label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold">Best time window<select class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] bg-[var(--koa-ivory)] px-4 py-3" name="preferredTime" required><option value="">Choose one</option><option>Morning</option><option>Midday</option><option>Afternoon</option><option>Evening</option></select></label><label class="grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold sm:col-span-2">Alternate day/time<textarea class="min-h-24 rounded-xl border border-[var(--koa-line)] bg-[var(--koa-ivory)] px-4 py-3" name="alternateWindow" placeholder="Give us another window that works for you."></textarea></label><button class="sm:col-span-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--koa-forest)] px-6 py-4 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[.13em] text-white" type="submit">Request discovery call</button></div></form></div></section>
</main><Footer/>
</BaseLayout>